        "column": 0,
        "height": 1,
        "row": 0,
        "width": 12
      },
      "chart": {
        "name": "Birds header",
        "programText": "",
        "options": {
          "type": "Text",
          "markdown": "# Birds\n\n**Typical by now** = average detections up to this hour over the previous 14 days. **Rare** = species with under 10 detections ever, heard today. **Hours since last detection** is normally high overnight; a large value in daylight means the station or mic is down, not the sync.\n\n[Overview](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_OVERVIEW_MISSION_CONTROL>) \u00b7 [Bot Ops](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_BOT_OPS>) \u00b7 [Trading](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_TRADING>) \u00b7 [Golf](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_GOLF>) \u00b7 **Birds** \u00b7 [Home](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_HOME>) \u00b7 [Ops](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_OPS>)\n\nColors: green = fine, gold = watch (75% of budget used), red = act now. Tile titles say what to do."
        },
        "description": null,
        "id": "<CHART_ID_77>"
      }
    },
